From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BukkitPatcher <bukkitpatcher@local.dev>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:15:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] optimize PalettedContainer#get

Remove a redundant cast in readPalette() - Data<T> already directly
implements FastPaletteData<T> in this codebase. The VarHandle-based
acquire read from upstream's version of this patch wasn't needed here
since our 'data' field is already 'public volatile' (upstream's is
private, requiring VarHandle for equivalent memory semantics).

Backported from Leaf ver/26.2 (original author: hayanesuru) to
ver/1.21.4.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
index 82a5d45858067f8bd6d000d2eafc13fe2cb6f834..a1e8cb2032afe396bec4d05b96253371002ee78d 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/PalettedContainer.java
@@ -105,7 +105,7 @@ public class PalettedContainer<T> implements PaletteResize<T>, PalettedContainer
     }
 
     private T readPalette(final PalettedContainer.Data<T> data, final int paletteIdx) {
-        final T[] palette = ((ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.patches.fast_palette.FastPaletteData<T>)(Object)data).moonrise$getPalette();
+        final T[] palette = data.moonrise$getPalette(); // Leaf - optimize PalettedContainer#get - remove type cast
         if (palette == null) {
             return this.readPaletteSlow(data, paletteIdx);
         }
